<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2CO" style="id">- TarifitLS</book>
  <para style="h">2 Ayṯ-Kurinṯ</para>
  <para style="toc3">2Kur</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Ayṯ-Kurinṯ</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ṯabrat wis ṯnayen n arrasul Bulus ɣar Ayṯ-Kurinṯ</para>
  <para style="mt1">Ṯabrat wis ṯnayen n arrasul Bulus ɣar Ayṯ-Kurinṯ</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2CO 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 1:1" />
    <char style="it">Ṯabrat-a zzayi nec</char> Bulus ig iǧan ḏ arrasul n Ƹisa Lmasiḥ s ȓxaḍar n Arebbi, akiḏi umaṯneɣ Timutawus. Tariɣ i jmaƹeṯ n ȓmuminin n Arebbi yinni iǧan ḏi ṯendint n Kurinṯ ḏ marra ȓmuminin ṣṣaliḥin ƹaweḏ ig iǧan ḏi lʼiqlim n Uxaya amen-ṯekmaȓ. <verse eid="2CO 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 1:2" />Akiḏwem yiȓi arḍa ḏ ȓehna zi Arebbi Babaṯneɣ ḏ Ƹisa Lmasiḥ Siḏiṯneɣ.<verse eid="2CO 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ṣṣbar ḏi tamara</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 1:3" />Aḏ itwabarek Arebbi Babas n Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa Lmasiḥ. Netta ƹaweḏ ḏ Babas n arraḥmeṯ ḏ netta ḏ Arebbi ig itƹawan marra iwḏan. <verse eid="2CO 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 1:4" />Itƹawan-aneɣ ḏi marra tamara nneɣ ḥima neccin s umƹawan-a iy zi ḏaneɣ itƹawan Arebbi nzemmar a nƹawen yinni iǧan ḏi kuȓ tamara. <verse eid="2CO 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 1:5" />Liʼanna mammec aƹeddeb n Lmasiḥ itenfeyyaḍ-d itaḏaf ḏi ṯuḏarṯ nneɣ amenni ƹaweḏ s Lmasiḥ itenfeyyaḍ-d umƹawan nneɣ. <verse eid="2CO 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 1:6" />Meȓa netwazeyyar neccin aqa manayenni bac kenniw aḏ twaƹawnem bac aḏ twasnejjmem. Meȓa netwaƹawen neccin aqa manayenni bac ƹaweḏ aḏ twaƹawnem kenniw. Aqa amƹawan-a itarew-d ḏaywem ijjen n ṣṣbar xmi tƹeddabem s min netƹeddab neccin. <verse eid="2CO 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 1:7" />Lʼamal nneɣ ƹlaḥsab kenniw ijheḏ. Aqa nessen mammec ṯcarrcem ḏi tamara nneɣ, amenni ƹaweḏ nessen aḏ tcarrcem ḏeg umƹawan nneɣ.<verse eid="2CO 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 1:8" />Ay ayṯma, nexs aḏ tessnem tamara iy xaneɣ ikkin ḏi lʼiqlim n Asya. Tuɣa netwazeyyar aṭṭas neccin, azeyyar nni tuɣaṯ ktar zi jjheḏ nneɣ war nzemmar azzayes neṣbar ḥetta wami nefqeḏ lʼamal bac a neddar. <verse eid="2CO 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 1:9" />Wah, nḥessa ḏeg yixef nneɣ belli netwaḥkam s ȓmewṯ. <char style="it">Iwqeƹ manayenni</char> bac war netƹewwiȓ ca x yixef nneɣ, a nƹewweȓ x Arebbi wenni iy d isnekkaren yinni immuṯen. <verse eid="2CO 1:9" /><verse number="10-11" style="v" sid="2CO 1:10-11" />Isenjem-aneɣ-d zeg yijjen n ȓmewṯ ḏ ṯaƹeffant u netta <char style="it">ƹaḏ</char> aqa isenjam-aneɣ. Ntegg ḏayes lʼamal nneɣ belli ƹaḏ aḏaneɣ isenjem wami kenniw ḏaneɣ tƹawanem s ṯẓaǧiṯ nwem. Ṯumma aṭṭas n yiwḏan aḏ sgaƹƹḏen ṣṣut nsen ɣar Arebbi aṯ cekkaren x lbaraka nni iy ḏaneɣ ɣa yuc xmi iy ɣa ṯestajeb aṭṭas n ṯẓaǧiṯ nsen xaneɣ.<verse eid="2CO 1:10-11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Arrasul Bulus iʼejjel zziyara nnes ɣar Kurinṯ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 1:12" />Aqa neccin nteftaxar zi ḍḍamir nneɣ iƹni icehheḏ belli nuyur mliḥ ḏi ddunect-a xaṣṣatan akiḏwem s yijjen n nniyyeṯ ḏ wuȓ iṣfan zi Arebbi. War iǧi bu s yijjen n ȓefhameṯ n ddunect-a; Lla, s yijjen n arḍa n Arebbi. <verse eid="2CO 1:12" /><verse number="13-14" style="v" sid="2CO 1:13-14" />Cuf, kuȓ ṯamesȓayṯ iy ḏawem d ntari <char style="it">ḏi ṯebrat-a</char> ṯzemmarem at tɣarem aḏas ṯfehmem. U waxxa war ḏaneɣ tefhimem ca ȓexxu ḏi marra ṯimesȓayin, nec tmenniɣ aḏaneɣ ṯfehmem mliḥ bac azzayneɣ teftaxarem ḏi Nhar nni n Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa mammec azzaywem nteftaxar neccin.<verse eid="2CO 1:13-14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 1:15" />U s <char style="it">lʼiftixar-a</char> tuɣa rezzuɣ ḏ amezwaru aɣarwem d ggeɣ ijjen n zziyara ḥima aḏawem dubliɣ lbaraka. <verse eid="2CO 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 1:16" />Iƹni tuɣa rezzuɣ axawem d kkeɣ xmi ɣa raḥeɣ ɣar lʼiqlim n Masidunya, menbaƹd aɣarwem d ƹeqbeɣ zi Masidunya bac aḏayi ṯƹawnem aḏ safareɣ ɣar ṯmurṯ n Yahuḏiya. <verse eid="2CO 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 1:17" />Wami tuɣa nec txeṭṭaṭeɣ aḏ ggeɣ manayenni, ma ḏewwȓeɣ ḏeg wawaȓ waha? Niɣ ma txeṭṭaṭeɣ am yijjen n bnaḏem n ddunect-a waha, iƹni aḏ iniɣ wah-wah niɣ lla-lla ḏi nnefs n ȓweqṯ?<verse eid="2CO 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 1:18" />Am Arebbi ḏayes ttiqeṯ netta, neccin ƹaweḏ qa awaȓ nneɣ i kenniw war iǧi bu ḏ wah akeḏ lla. <verse eid="2CO 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 1:19" />Liʼanna Mmis n Arebbi iƹni Ƹisa Lmasiḥ netbeccar-iṯ jarawem nec uȓa ḏ Silas uȓa ḏ Timutawus. Lmasiḥ war iǧi bu ḏ wah akeḏ lla, netta iǧa ȓebda ḏ &lt;Wah&gt; u ṣafi. <verse eid="2CO 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 1:20" />Liʼanna netta ḏayes iy iqqar Arebbi &lt;Wah&gt; i marra ṯimesȓayin iy iƹaheḏ Arebbi. S manaya zi Ƹisa neqqar &lt;Amin&gt; i lƹaḍama n Arebbi. <verse eid="2CO 1:20" /><verse number="21-22" style="v" sid="2CO 1:21-22" />Arebbi netta iy ḏaneɣ isbedden mliḥ akiḏwem ḏi Lmasiḥ. Ixḍar-aneɣ iḍbeƹ-aneɣ s ṭṭabaƹ nnes yuca-aneɣ Arruḥ nnes iggi-ṯ ḏeg wuȓawen nneɣ am ijjen n ttesbiq.<verse eid="2CO 1:21-22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CO 1:23" />Iwa tettareɣ i Arebbi aḏ yiȓi netta ḏ ccaheḏ inu qa nec tuɣa rezzuɣ axawem ḥinneɣ wami ugiɣ aɣarwem d aseɣ ɣar Kurinṯ. <verse eid="2CO 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CO 1:24" />Lʼianna war iǧi bu netḥekkem x lʼiman nwem; Lla, nxeddem akiḏwem bac aḏ tfarḥem. Aqa s lʼiman nwem iy ṯbeddam nican.<verse eid="2CO 1:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2CO 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 2:1" />Cuf, ggiɣ ḏi ȓbaȓ inu war teggeɣ bu ca n zziyara nneɣni bac war kenniw sxeyyiqeɣ ca. <verse eid="2CO 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 2:2" />Liʼanna meȓa sxeyyaqeɣ-kenniw nec, wi ɣa iqqimen bac aḏayi isfareḥ illa kenniw iy sxeyyaqeɣ nec? <verse eid="2CO 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 2:3" />Tuɣa uriɣ <char style="it">ṯabrat nni</char> bac war ḏayi tesxeyyaqem ca, rezzuɣ axmi d ɣa aseɣ ɣarwem u labud aḏayi tesfarḥem. Meȓa farḥeɣ aḏ iȓiɣ nec metʼakked aḏ tfarḥem uȓa ḏ kenniw. <verse eid="2CO 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 2:4" />Liʼanna uriɣ-awem-t-id s yijjen n uziyyar ḏ yijjen n uxiyyeq zeg wuȓ inu ḏ waṭṭas n imeṭṭawen. War iǧi bu <char style="it">nniɣ-awem-t</char> ḥima akenniw sxeyyqeɣ; Lla, ḥima aḏ tessnem mecḥaȓ ṯemɣar ȓemḥibbeṯ inu ɣarwem.<verse eid="2CO 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Semḥem-as i wenni iƹeṣṣan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 2:5" />Fa meȓa ijjen tuɣa isxeyyaq-ikenniw, war iǧi bu ḏ nec ig isxeyyeq lla. Imken isxeyyeq-ikenniw marra niɣ ȓebƹaḍ zzaywem (war xseɣ ca aḏ semɣareɣ lqaḍiya-ya). <verse eid="2CO 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 2:6" />Bnaḏem-a, lƹiqab nni iy ḏas ṯeggim teqȓiban marra iḏwem, baraka xas. <verse eid="2CO 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 2:7" />Ȓexxu aḏas ṯsemḥem ƹawnem-ṯ bac war iɣerreq ca s uxeyyeq aṭṭas. <verse eid="2CO 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 2:8" />S manaya tettareɣ zzaywem aḏas ṯesbeyynem ƹaweḏ ȓemḥibbeṯ nwem. <verse eid="2CO 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 2:9" />Uriɣ-awem-d manayenni bac akenniw jarrbeɣ aḏ ssneɣ ma tṭaƹam ḏi marra ma lla. <verse eid="2CO 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 2:10" />Wenni umi ɣa ṯsemḥem uȓa ḏ nec aḏas semḥeɣ. Meȓa ḏinni can ȓḥajeṯ aḏas semḥeɣ, qa semḥeɣ-as-t. Semḥeɣ-as ƹlaḥsab kenniw, icheḏ xas Lmasiḥ. <verse eid="2CO 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 2:11" />Manaya ḥima Cciṭan war ḏaneɣ ixeddeƹ ca, aqa war nɣeffeȓ ca x min itciṭin netta.<verse eid="2CO 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">A nerbeḥ s Lmasiḥ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 2:12" />Fa wami d uwḍeɣ ɣar ṯendint n Traws bac aḏ beccareɣ s Lʼinjil n Lmasiḥ, ufiɣ ṯnurzem-ayi-d ijjen n ṯewwarṯ n Siḏiṯneɣ. <verse eid="2CO 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 2:13" />Walakin uȓ inu war iǧi ca mertaḥ wami war ufiɣ ca ḏinni uma Titus, mṣafaḍeɣ xasen uyureɣ ɣar Masidunya.<verse eid="2CO 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 2:14" />Walakin a neḥmeḏ Arebbi. Netta ȓebda isuggur-aneɣ ḏeg ubriḏ n arbaḥ s Lmasiḥ u zzayneɣ neccin itentacar ȓefwaḥ n ṯusna <char style="it">x Lmasiḥ</char>. <verse eid="2CO 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 2:15" />Liʼanna neccin ḏ ijjen n ȓefwaḥ n Lmasiḥ ɣar Arebbi jar n yinni inejjmen ḏ yinni ifennan. <verse eid="2CO 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 2:16" />Neccin am ccum n ȓmewṯ ɣar yinni ifennan, ḏ ccum n ṯuḏarṯ ɣar yinni inejjmen. Iwa war ḏinni ḥadd iy ɣa izemmaren i ȓxeḏmeṯ-a! <verse eid="2CO 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 2:17" />Aqa neccin maci am xarebbi n yiwḏan iteggen ttijara ḏeg wawaȓ n Arebbi, neccin ḏi Lmasiḥ nessawaȓ s wuȓ iṣfa zi Arebbi u zzaṯ i Arebbi.<verse eid="2CO 2:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2CO 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 3:1" />Neccin, ma nebḏa a ncekkar ixef nneɣ ƹaweḏ zaƹma bac aḏawem nqeddem ixef nneɣ? Ma neccin am ca n iṯarrasen ɣa iḥḏajen ṯibraṯin bac axaneɣ cehhḏent, iƹni <char style="it">ṯibraṯin nni aḏ d asent</char> zzaywem niɣ aɣarwem <char style="it">d asent</char>? <verse eid="2CO 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 3:2" />Lla, kenniw s yixef nwem ḏ ṯabrat nneɣ iƹni ṯcehhḏem xaneɣ. Ṯabrat-a ṯura g wuȓawen nneɣ, ssnen-teṯ qqaren-teṯ marra iwḏan. <verse eid="2CO 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 3:3" />Ṯbanem-d belli kenniw am yijjen n ṯebrat zi Lmasiḥ, nessiweḍ-it neccin. War ṯuri ca s smex,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Smex netta ḏ lemdad niɣ ḏ ȓmidad.</char></note> <char style="it">ṯura</char> s Arruḥ n Arebbi iddaren. War <char style="it">ṯenqic</char> ca ḏi ṯeȓwiḥin n uzru, <char style="it">ṯenqec</char> ḏi ṯeȓwiḥin n wuȓ n bnaḏem.<verse eid="2CO 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 3:4" />Manaya neqqar-iṯ s ttiqeṯ iy ɣarneɣ ḏi Arebbi s Lmasiḥ. <verse eid="2CO 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 3:5" />Iƹni marra manaya war ḏas nzemmar ca neccin s yixef nneɣ. War netḥessib ca belli ṯizemmar-a tasent-id zzayneɣ; Lla, tasent-id zi Arebbi. <verse eid="2CO 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 3:6" />Ḏ netta iy ḏaneɣ yucin ṯizemmar-a bac a niȓi ḏ ixeddamen n yijjen n Ȓƹaheḏ ḏ jḏiḏ. Ȓƹaheḏ-a maci s ccariƹa; Lla, ȓƹaheḏ-a s Arruḥ n Arebbi. Liʼanna ccariƹa ṯneqq, Arruḥ n Arebbi netta iseddar.<verse eid="2CO 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lƹaḍama n Ȓƹaheḏ ḏ jḏiḏ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 3:7" />Fa ccariƹa nni n ȓmewṯ, ṯira nnes neqcent ḏi ṯeȓwiḥin n uzru. ccariƹa nni ṯusa-d s yijjen n lƹaḍama ḏ ṯameqqrant, ataf Ayṯ-Israʼil war zemmaren aḏ qqimen xezzaren ḏeg uɣembub n Musa s lƹaḍama nni iy ḏayes itceƹciƹen waxxa tiȓi traḥ-as lƹaḍama nni. <verse eid="2CO 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 3:8" />Ȓexxu ȓƹaheḏ ruḥiya, lƹaḍama nnes ktar aṭṭas zi ccariƹa nni! <verse eid="2CO 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 3:9" />Meȓa ɣares lƹaḍama ɣar ccariƹa nni iy tuɣa d itawin lḥisab ḏ lƹiqab, ataf ȓƹaheḏ-a iy d itawin ṣṣulḥ mecḥaȓ ṯemɣar lƹaḍama nnes ktar zi ṯenni nneɣni. <verse eid="2CO 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 3:10" />Ḏ ṣṣaḥ ccariƹa nni iy tuɣa ɣar ṯeǧa lƹaḍama, ȓexxu war ɣares ṯeqqim ca lƹaḍama iƹni ak lƹaḍama-ya ṯameqqrant aṭṭas iy ɣares ɣar <char style="it">ȓƹaheḏ nni ruḥiya</char>. <verse eid="2CO 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 3:11" />Cuf, min itwatekksen <char style="it">iƹni ccariƹa nni</char>, meȓa ṯusa-d s yijjen n lƹaḍama, wa labud lƹaḍama-ya <char style="it">n ȓƹaheḏ</char> itduman aḏ tiȓi ktar aṭṭas zi ṯen nneɣni!<verse eid="2CO 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 3:12" />Iḏen, meȓa ɣarneɣ ijjen n lʼamal am wanita ataf ɣarneɣ ijjen n zƹameṯ. <verse eid="2CO 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 3:13" />War neǧi ca am Musa iɣemmes i uɣembub nnes s yijjen n ltam<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ltam netta ḏ ijjen n ṭṭarf n ṯcuqqet teggen-teṯ x uɣembub itiȓi zi ṯiṭṭawin aȓ wadday.</char></note> bac war tɣimin ca Ayṯ-Israʼil txezzaren ḏayes xmi ataf itraḥ-as uceƹceƹ nni. <verse eid="2CO 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 3:14" />Niṯni ȓaƹquȓaṯ nsen twaqesḥen war fehhmen ca. Aȓ nhara xmi ɣa ɣaren ḏi Ȓƹaheḏ nni aqḏim tafen ltam nni ƹaḏ ḏayes. Ltam nni war itwakkes ca, ɣir s Lmasiḥ iy ɣa itwakkes. <verse eid="2CO 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 3:15" />Wah, aȓ nhara xmi ɣa ɣaren Ayṯ-Israʼil ḏi Lkitab n Musa ataf uȓawen nsen ɣemmsen s yijjen n ltam. <verse eid="2CO 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 3:16" />Walakin xmi ɣa yamen can yijjen zi Siḏiṯneɣ, aḏas itwakkes ltam nni. <verse eid="2CO 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 3:17" />Cuf, Siḏiṯneɣ netta ḏ Arruḥ, mani ma iǧa Arruḥ n Siḏiṯneɣ ḏinni lḥurriya <char style="it">ruḥiya</char>. <verse eid="2CO 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 3:18" />Ȓexxu neccin aɣembub nneɣ war iɣmis s walu. Netwaȓa lƹaḍama n Siḏiṯneɣ, netwabeddaȓ bac a niȓi ḏ ijjen n ṣṣifeṯ nnes s yijjen n lƹaḍama itmarnin. Manaya itas-d zi Siḏiṯneɣ ig iǧan ḏ Arruḥ.<verse eid="2CO 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="2CO 4" />
  <para style="s">Lʼinjil nnur nnes itceƹciƹ ḏi ṯaǧest</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 4:1" />S manaya, war ntefciȓ ca minzi ɣarneɣ ȓƹaheḏ-a wanita s arraḥmeṯ n Arebbi. <verse eid="2CO 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 4:2" />Neccin netbeƹƹaḏ x ṯmesȓayin n ȓefḍiḥeṯ ig itwaxeddmen s ṯnufra. War nesxeddim ca ṯaḥraymiṯ, war netḥerrif ca awaȓ n Arebbi. Neccin zzaṯ i Arebbi nseȓmaḏ lḥaqiqa bȓa ma at nesnuffar. Ammu ɣarsen marra iwḏan ḏi ḍḍamir nsen belli ḏayneɣ ttiqeṯ. <verse eid="2CO 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 4:3" />Lʼinjil nneɣ meȓa iɣemmes s yijjen n ltam,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ltam netta ḏ ijjen n ṭṭarf n ṯcuqqet teggen-teṯ x uɣembub itiȓi zi ṯiṭṭawin aȓ wadday.</char></note> iɣemmes ɣir i yinni ifennan. <verse eid="2CO 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 4:4" />Yinni war yuminen ca ȓaƹquȓaṯ nsen isṭemmeṣ-iṯen <char style="it">Ibȓis wenni iǧan am</char> arebbi n ddunect-a zaƹma. Niṯni war zemmaren aḏ ẓren nnur n Lʼinjil iƹni lƹaḍama n Lmasiḥ, netta iǧan ḏ ṣṣifeṯ n Arebbi. <verse eid="2CO 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 4:5" />War netbeccir ca s yixef nneɣ, netbeccar s Ƹisa Lmasiḥ iƹni netta ḏ Siḏiṯneɣ. U neccin ḏ ixeddamen nwem ƹlaḥsab Ƹisa. <verse eid="2CO 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 4:6" />Ḏ Arebbi ig innan: "Nnur aḏ iceƹceƹ zi ṯaǧest." Ḏ Arebbi-ya ig iceƹcƹen ḏeg wuȓawen nneɣ bac a nessen lƹaḍama n Arebbi ig itceƹciƹen ḏeg wuḏem n Ƹisa Lmasiḥ.<verse eid="2CO 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 4:7" />Fa ȓkenz-a wanita aqaṯ ɣarneɣ ḏeg iɣerrafen n ucaȓ <char style="it">iƹni ḏi ddat nneɣ,</char> bac aḏ d imeḍhar belli jjheḏ-a ameqqran aṭṭas itas-d zi Arebbi maci zzayneɣ. <verse eid="2CO 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 4:8" />Neccin netwazeyyar zi mkuȓ jjiheṯ, walakin war netwaḥesseȓ ca. War nessin ca mani ɣa narr s uzeǧif, walakin war ntefciȓ ca. <verse eid="2CO 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 4:9" />Netwaƹeddab, walakin war neqqim ca waḥeḏneɣ. Netwaɣḍeȓ, walakin war nerriz ca. <verse eid="2CO 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 4:10" />Ȓebda narebbu ḏi ddat nneɣ ȓmewṯ n Ƹisa bac aḏ d tmeḍhar uȓa ḏ ṯuḏarṯ n Ƹisa ḏi ddat nneɣ. <verse eid="2CO 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 4:11" />Liʼanna neccin ig iddaren netwasellam ȓebda ɣar ȓmewṯ ƹlaḥsab Ƹisa ḥima ṯuḏarṯ n Ƹisa aḏ d tmeḍhar ḏi ddat nneɣ itmettan. <verse eid="2CO 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 4:12" />X manaya xmi neccin netwajah ȓmewṯ, kenniw tiȓi ḏaywem ṯuḏarṯ.<verse eid="2CO 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 4:13" />Iqqar yijjen ḏi Lkitab: "Umneɣ, s manaya ssiwȓeɣ." Nnefs lʼiman-a iǧan ḏayneɣ, zzayes iy ntamen zzayes iy nessawaȓ. <verse eid="2CO 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 4:14" />Nessen wenni iy d isekkaren Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa netta ƹaweḏ aḏaneɣ d isekkar ak Ƹisa aḏaneɣ iseḥḍar akiḏwem zzaṯ nnes. <verse eid="2CO 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 4:15" />Cuf, manaya iwqeƹ marra bac akenniw infeƹ. Xmi itentacar arḍa ɣar yiwḏan aṭṭas s waṭṭas iƹni arḍa-ya aḏ d isfeyyeḍ ccuker i lƹaḍama n Arebbi.<verse eid="2CO 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 4:16" />X manaya neccin war ntefciȓ ca. Waxxa ṭṭabiƹa n ddat nneɣ ɣar barra traḥ, ṭṭabiƹa nneɣ ɣar ḏaxeȓ tejhiḏ nhar x nhar. <verse eid="2CO 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 4:17" />Cuf, ȓemḥayen nneɣ fsusent traḥent tasent-id ḏeɣya, sewjaḏent-aneɣ ɣar yijjen n lƹaḍama ḏ ṯameqqrant bȓa ȓeqyas. <verse eid="2CO 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 4:18" />War nesrusi ca ṯiṭṭawin nneɣ ḏi min netwaȓa, nsrusa-ṯent ḏi min war netwiȓi ca. Liʼanna min netwaȓa ḏeɣya itraḥ, min war netwiȓi ca ḏ wenni ig itduman i ȓebda.<verse eid="2CO 4:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="2CO 5" />
  <para style="s">Amcan nneɣ ḏeg ujenna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 5:1" />Cuf, neccin nessen meȓa irez uqiḍun-a <char style="it">iƹni ddat nneɣ</char> n ddunect-a, ataf ɣarneɣ ijjen n ṯzeddiɣṯ nneɣni zi Arebbi. Ṯaddarṯ nni war ibnin ca s ifassen tduma i ȓebda. <verse eid="2CO 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 5:2" />Ȓexxu neccin nnehhek ḏayneɣ mezȓi a neɣmes s ddat nneɣ n ujenna. <verse eid="2CO 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 5:3" />Xmi ɣa neɣmes zzayes, ataf war ḏaneɣ tifen ca ḏ iƹaryanen. <verse eid="2CO 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 5:4" />Liʼanna xmi netɣemmas s ddat-a nneɣ, tbessaȓ xaneɣ neccin ƹaḏ nnehhek. Iwa war nrezzu ca a niȓi bȓa arruḍ, nrezzu a neɣmes <char style="it">s ddat nneɣ n ujenna</char>, mayemmi? Bac min ifennan aṯ iseɣȓey min war itmettin. <verse eid="2CO 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 5:5" />Wi ḏaneɣ iswejḏen i manayenni? Netta ḏ Arebbi, yuca-aneɣ-d Arruḥ nnes ḏ ijjen n ttesbiq.<verse eid="2CO 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 5:6" />Iḏen ƹemmarṣ a nefceȓ neccin. Nessen meȓa ƹaḏ aqaneɣ ḏi ddat-a n ddunect-a ntaggwaj zi Siḏiṯneɣ. <verse eid="2CO 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 5:7" />Aqa netƹic s lʼiman maci s min netwaȓa. <verse eid="2CO 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 5:8" />War ntefciȓ ca, lla! Maƹlic neccin meȓa ntaggwaj zi ddat-a <char style="it">n ddunect-a</char> ataf neccin netƹic ak Siḏiṯneɣ. <verse eid="2CO 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 5:9" /><char style="it">X manayenni mixef nrezzu?</char> Nrezzu axas narḍa waxxa nzeddeɣ ḏi ddat-a <char style="it">n ddunect-a</char> niɣ ntaggwaj zzayes. <verse eid="2CO 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 5:10" />Liʼanna labud a nbedd marra iḏneɣ zzaṯ i lƹarc n Lmasiḥ mani iy ɣa netwaḥkem. Kuȓ ijjen aṯ ijaza x min isḏaheǧ ƹlaḥsab ṯimesȓayin nni ig igga wami izḏeɣ ḏi ddat, ḏ ṯiṣebḥanin niɣ ḏ ṯiƹeffanin. <verse eid="2CO 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 5:11" />Falihaḏa wami nessen a neggweḏ zi Siḏiṯneɣ, nrezzu iwḏan aḏ qtanƹen.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="2CO 5:11">Ȓƹaheḏ n ṣṣulḥ</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CO 5:11">Y min neƹna neccin issen-iṯ Arebbi mliḥ, u tmenniɣ ƹaweḏ ḍḍamir nwem aḏ issen manayenni. <verse eid="2CO 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 5:12" />Ma nebḏa a ncekkar ixef nneɣ ƹaweḏ zaƹma? Lla, nticc-awem minzi xaneɣ ɣa teftaxarem. Mayemmi? Iƹni ḥima aɣarwem yiȓi minzi ɣa ṯarrem x yinni iteftaxaren x min d itbanen ɣar barra maci min iǧan ɣar ḏaxeȓ ḏeg wuȓ.<verse eid="2CO 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 5:13" />Cuf, meȓa iruḥ-aneɣ ȓaƹqeȓ zaƹma, manaya jaraneɣ ḏ Arebbi. Meȓa ɣarneɣ ȓaƹqeȓ, ataf manaya mliḥ i kenniw. <verse eid="2CO 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 5:14" />Liʼanna ȓemḥibbeṯ n Lmasiḥ tsayṭar xaneɣ wami nessen ijjen immuṯ ƹlaḥsab marra iwḏan. Falihaḏa ȓmewṯ nnes ḏ ȓmewṯ n marra iwḏan. <verse eid="2CO 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 5:15" />Immuṯ netta ƹlaḥsab marra iwḏan bac yinni iddaren war teddaren ca i yixef nsen waha, aḏ ddaren i wenni xasen immuṯen ṯumma itwasekkar-d zi ȓmewṯ.<verse eid="2CO 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 5:16" />X manayenni, zi ssa aȓ ṯsawent neccin war nxezzar ca ḏi ḥadd ƹlaḥsab ȓaƹqeȓ n ddunect-a. Waxxa nxezzar qbeȓ ḏi Lmasiḥ ƹlaḥsab ȓaƹqeȓ n ddunect-a, ȓexxu war ṯ netwiȓi ca amenni. <verse eid="2CO 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 5:17" />S manaya, wenni iǧan ḏi Lmasiḥ aqa itwaxȓeq-d ḏ jḏiḏ; min iǧan ḏ aqḏim iƹḏu yusa-d min iǧan ḏ jḏiḏ. <verse eid="2CO 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 5:18" />Manaya marra zi Arebbi, isemṣȓaḥ-aneɣ akiḏes s Lmasiḥ yuca-aneɣ-d a nbeccar s ȓƹaheḏ n ṣṣulḥ. <verse eid="2CO 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 5:19" />Iƹni Arebbi igga ḏi Lmasiḥ bac aḏ isemṣȓaḥ iwḏan akiḏes, war xasen iḥesseb ca ȓmuƹṣiyaṯ nsen. Ƹaweḏ Arebbi ikellef xaneɣ awaȓ-a wanita n ṣṣulḥ. <verse eid="2CO 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 5:20" />Falihaḏa neccin ḏ lmubcirin n Lmasiḥ, Arebbi issekk ṭṭalab nnes x ufus nneɣ. Nṭalab-ikenniw ƹlaḥsab Lmasiḥ aḏ temṣȓaḥem ak Arebbi. <verse eid="2CO 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 5:21" />Tuɣa wanita war ɣares bu ȓmuƹṣiyeṯ yarri-ṯ Arebbi ḏ ȓƹiḏ nneɣ ḥima aḏaneɣ yarr nican ak Arebbi.<verse eid="2CO 5:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="2CO 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 6:1" />Fa neccin ig ixeddmen ak Arebbi ntettar i kenniw neqqar-awem: Maci aḏ tqebbȓem arḍa n Arebbi war zzayes ṯxeddmem ca. <verse eid="2CO 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 6:2" />Aqa netta iqqar:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:2">&lt;Wami iy xafi ṯarḍa ȓweqṯ sȓiɣ-ac,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:2">nhar nni n ufekki ƹawneɣ-c.&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CO 6:2">Haqac, ȓexxu ḏ ȓweqṯ ig yarḍan x Arebbi. Haqac, ȓexxu ḏ nhar ig isenjamen.<verse eid="2CO 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 6:3" />War nesrusi walu ḏeg ubriḏ i ḥadd bac aṯ neɣḍeȓ ḥima war tifen bu ȓƹib ḏi ȓxeḏmeṯ nneɣ. <verse eid="2CO 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 6:4" />Innama, neccin netqeddam-awem ixef nneɣ s marra minzi neccin ḏ ixeddamen n Arebbi: Iƹni nṣebbar aṭṭas; tekkent xaneɣ ȓemḥayen ḏ tamara ḏ uziyyar; <verse eid="2CO 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 6:5" />neccin tmarraṯen-aneɣ, tḥebbasen-aneɣ, teggen-aneɣ ȓfawḍa; neccin neccaṯ tamara, neqqim ḏi ǧiyaȓi bȓa iḍeṣ, neǧuz. <verse eid="2CO 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 6:6" /><char style="it">Netqeddam-awem ixef nneɣ</char> s ṣṣfa iy ɣarneɣ ḏ ȓefhameṯ ḏ ttasiƹ n ȓxaḍar ḏ ȓxir ḏ Arruḥ iqeddsen ḏ ijjen n ȓemḥibbeṯ bȓa nnifaq; <verse eid="2CO 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 6:7" />s wawaȓ n lḥaqiqa ḏ jjheḏ n Arebbi ḏ ȓesnaḥ n ȓḥaqq ig iǧan ḏeg ufusi ḏ uẓermaḍ. <verse eid="2CO 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 6:8" /><char style="it">Netqeddam-awem ixef nneɣ liʼanna iwḏan</char> tweqqaren-aneɣ sbehdaȓen-aneɣ; qqaren ḏayneɣ ȓbaṭeȓ semɣaren-aneɣ; tarran-aneɣ ḏ iɣeccacen walakin neccin war ḏayneɣ bu ixarriqen; <verse eid="2CO 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 6:9" />nekkaren-aneɣ walakin neccin netwassen mliḥ; netmetta walakin neccin nteddar; tƹaqaben-aneɣ walakin neccin war ḏaneɣ neqqen ca; <verse eid="2CO 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 6:10" />neccin netwazeyyar walakin ȓebda nfarreḥ; neccin ḏ ipubriṯen nserbaḥ aṭṭas n yiwḏan; war ɣarneɣ walu walakin ɣarneɣ kuȓci.<verse eid="2CO 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 6:11" />Ay Ayṯ-Kurinṯ, nessiweȓ akiḏwem s marra ṣṣaraḥa, uȓawen nneɣ nnurzmen aṭṭas i kenniw. <verse eid="2CO 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 6:12" />Ȓemḥibbeṯ nneɣ war xawem t nteɣliq ca neccin, ḏ kenniw iy xaneɣ t iteɣlaqen. <verse eid="2CO 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 6:13" />Ssawaȓeɣ akiḏwem am ṯarwa inu. Iwa jjeṯ waxxa ḏ uȓawen nwem aḏ nnurzmen aṭṭas am neccin.<verse eid="2CO 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">War carrcem ca ak yinni war yuminen ca</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 6:14" />War teggeṯ xawem ṯzayȓut<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6.14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ṯzayȓut nettaṯ ḏ ṯzagȓut. Teggen-teṯ x yirawen n ifunasen ijjen n nhar cerrzen zzayes.</char></note> ak yinni war yuminen ca, war tiȓiṯ ca ḏ ṯiyuya<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6.14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ṯiyuya nettaṯ ḏ ṯiyuga.</char></note> akiḏsen. Ma ḏinni ca n ȓḥajeṯ ig icarrec ȓḥaqq ak ȓbaṭeȓ? Lla. Min icarrec nnur ak ṯaǧest? Walu. <verse eid="2CO 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 6:15" />Ma ḏinni ca n ȓḥajeṯ kif-kif jar Lmasiḥ ḏ Ibȓis? Lla. Ma ḏinni ca n ȓḥajeṯ ṯcarrec jar ȓmumen ḏ wenni war yuminen ca? Walu. <verse eid="2CO 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 6:16" />Min ṯcarrec ṯemziḏa ṯameqqrant n Arebbi ak lʼaṣnam? Walu. Cuf, neccin iy iǧan ḏ ṯamziḏa n Arebbi iddaren. Amenni iqqar Arebbi:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:16">&lt;Nec aḏ zeḏɣeɣ akiḏsen aḏ uyureɣ jarasen,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:16">aḏ iȓiɣ ḏ Arebbi nsen,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:16">niṯni aḏ iȓin ḏ ccaƹb inu.<verse eid="2CO 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 6:17" />X manaya iqqar Siḏi Arebbi:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:17">Ffɣem-d zi ȓwesṭ nsen ƹezȓeṯ ixef nwem,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:17">war tḥaḏaṯ ca min iǧan ḥaram.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:17">Uca nec akenniw qebȓeɣ,<verse eid="2CO 6:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 6:18" />aḏ iȓiɣ ḏ babaṯwem,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:18">kenniw aḏ tiȓim ḏ ṯarwa inu ḏ yissi inu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CO 6:18">Amenni iqqar Arebbi izemmaren i kuȓci.&gt;<verse eid="2CO 6:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="2CO 7" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 7:1" />Iḏen ay imƹizzen inu, wami ḏaneɣ iƹaheḏ <char style="it">Arebbi</char> x ṯmesȓayin-a labud a nessiṣfa ixef nneɣ zi marra min ḏaneɣ isexnizen ḏi ddat ḏ arruḥ ḥima a niȓi ḏ ṣṣaliḥin bȓa axeṭṭi s ṯiggwḏi n Arebbi.<verse eid="2CO 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Arrasul Bulus ṯesfarreḥ-iṯ jmaƹeṯ n ȓmuminin n Ayṯ-Kurinṯ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 7:2" />Arzmem-aneɣ kenniw imucan ḏeg wuȓawen nwem. Uȓa ḏ ijjen war ṯ neḍȓim ca, war ṯ nesƹewwej ca, war ṯ nɣecc ca. <verse eid="2CO 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 7:3" />War qqareɣ ca manaya bac akenniw ƹeyybeɣ lla. Ȓaḥeqqac nniɣ-awem qbeȓ qa kenniw ḏeg wuȓawen nneɣ, a nemmeṯ niɣ a neddar akiḏwem. <verse eid="2CO 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 7:4" />Nec teggeɣ akiḏwem zƹameṯ aṭṭas, lʼiftixar iy ɣari ḏaywem imɣar. Twacejjƹeɣ aṭṭas, ȓefraḥeṯ inu temfeyyaḍ-d x marra ȓemḥayen nneɣ.<verse eid="2CO 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 7:5" />Cuf, neccin wami d nuḏef ɣar lʼiqlim n Masidunya ddat nneɣ war ṯriyyeḥ ca, netwazeyyar zi mkuȓ jjiheṯ amenɣi ɣar barra ḏ ṯiggwḏi ɣar ḏaxeȓ. <verse eid="2CO 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 7:6" />Walakin Arebbi, iƹni wenni itƹawanen yinni itxeyyaqen iƹawen-aneɣ s umaṯneɣ Titus wami d yusa. <verse eid="2CO 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 7:7" />U maci ɣir wami d yusa Titus, <char style="it">iƹawen-aneɣ Arebbi</char> ƹaweḏ wami tuɣa ḏayes thillam. Ixbar-aneɣ Titus qa ṯweḥḥcem-ayi, qa ṯnedmem ṯrezzum xafi aṭṭas. Amenni ȓefraḥeṯ inu ṯarni ktar.<verse eid="2CO 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 7:8" />Iwa wami kenniw sxeyyqeɣ s ṯebrat nni inu <char style="it">nneɣni</char>, ḏ amezwaru tuɣa nedmeɣ ȓexxu war ndimeɣ ca. Iƹni nedmeɣ wami ẓriɣ ṯabrat nni inu ṯesxeyyeq-ikenniw ḏeg yijjen n ȓweqṯ walakin ṯeƹḏu ḏeɣya. <verse eid="2CO 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 7:9" />Ȓexxu nec farrḥeɣ. Maci wami ṯxeyyqem; Lla, wami ṯxeyyqem bac aḏ ttubem. Ṯxeyyqem iƹni ijjen n uxiyyeq zi Arebbi, amenni war kenniw ṯeȓqif uȓa ḏ ijjen n ṯxessarṯ zzayneɣ. <verse eid="2CO 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 7:10" />Cuf, axiyyeq zi Arebbi itarew-d ttuba, ttuba-ya ṯneddeh-ikenniw aḏ tnejmem war tejji bu ndameṯ. Axiyyeq zi ddunect-a lla, itarew-d ȓmewṯ. <verse eid="2CO 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 7:11" />Fekkareṯ kenniw ḏi min ḏaywem d itarew uxiyyeq-a zi Arebbi. Iƹni mecḥaȓ tḥawaȓem s wuȓ ṯrezzum aḏ tḥellem manaya ḏeɣya. Iƹni mecḥaȓ ṯnedmem mecḥaȓ ṯenxeȓƹem, ḏaywem ijjen n mezȓi ḏ ṯiggwḏi. Iƹni mecḥaȓ ṯeswejḏem aḏ tḥekmem nican. Min ma iǧan ḏi ṯmesȓayṯ-a kenniw war ḏaywem bu ȓƹib. <verse eid="2CO 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 7:12" />Nec uriɣ-awem-d ṯabrat nni, mayemmi? Ma ƹlaḥsab wenni iḍeȓmen niɣ ḏ wenni itwaḍeȓmen? Lla, uriɣ-awem-t-id bac akenniw sfehmeɣ zzaṯ i Arebbi mecḥaȓ iy ḏaneɣ teggem array s wuȓ. <verse eid="2CO 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 7:13" />S marra manaya netwaƹawen.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CO 7:13">Maci netwaƹawen neccin u ṣafi; Lla, ƹaweḏ nfareḥ aṭṭas wami neẓra mecḥaȓ ifareḥ Titus arruḥ nnes ṯesreyyḥem-ṯ kenniw marra. <verse eid="2CO 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 7:14" />Wami zzaywem ftaxareɣ ɣar Titus war iǧi mayemmi ɣa seḏḥiɣ ȓexxu. Ȓaḥeqqac mammec nessiweȓ akiḏwem nican ḏi marra, uȓa ḏ lʼiftixar nneɣ xawem ɣar Titus qa iffeɣ-d nican. <verse eid="2CO 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 7:15" />Netta aqa ṯeqqimem-as ḏeg wuȓ u ktar ƹaḏ xmi itfekkar ḏi array iy ḏas ṯeggim, iƹni ṯqebȓem-ṯ s yijjen n ṯiggwḏi terjijim. <verse eid="2CO 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 7:16" />Farrḥeɣ wami zemmareɣ axawem tƹewwaȓeɣ ḏi min ḏi ma.<verse eid="2CO 7:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="2CO 8" />
  <para style="s">Ijjen n lmiṯal n ṣṣaḏaqa zi ȓmuminin ig iǧan ḏi Masidunya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 8:1" />Fa ay ayṯma, nexs aḏ tessnem x arḍa nni iy ḏasent yuca Arebbi i ṯjumaƹ n ȓmuminin ig iǧan ḏi lʼiqlim n Masidunya. <verse eid="2CO 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 8:2" />Ṯekka xasen ijjen n ȓmiḥneṯ ḏ ṯameqqrant ṯeqseḥ xasen aṭṭas. Waxxa niṯni ḏ ipubriṯen war ɣarsen walu walakin niṯni ȓefraḥeṯ nsen ṯemɣar. Zi manayenni iy zi teffeɣ ijjen n ṣṣaḏaqa ḏ ṯameqqrant aṭṭas. <verse eid="2CO 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 8:3" />Aqa nec cehhḏeɣ ṣeddqen s min zemmaren aḏ ucen, qa ḏ ṣṣaḥ ṣeddqen ktar zi min zemmaren. Ggin manaya s ȓxaḍar nsen waḥeḏsen, <verse eid="2CO 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 8:4" />ttaren zzayneɣ s wuȓ nsen aḏ ƹawnen s ȓxir-a ȓmuminin ṣṣaliḥin <char style="it">iy iǧan ḏi ṯendint n Lquds</char>. <verse eid="2CO 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 8:5" />Neccin neḏhec wami ggin manayenni. Ƹlaḥsab min ixes Arebbi sellmen ḏ amezwaru ȓxaḍar nsen i Siḏiṯneɣ u ƹaḏ sellmen-ṯ i neccin.<verse eid="2CO 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 8:6" />Amenni iy nweṣṣa Titus wami tuɣa ibḏa ijemmeƹ zi qbeȓ ȓxir n ṣṣaḏaqa-ya zzaywem, ȓexxu nweṣṣa-ṯ at ikemmeȓ. <verse eid="2CO 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 8:7" />Kenniw teggem zyada ḏi marra ṯimesȓayin, iƹni ḏi lʼiman nwem ḏ lxuṭba nwem ḏ ṯusna nwem ḏ mammec iy tḥawaȓem s wuȓawen nwem u ḏ ȓemḥibbeṯ nwem i neccin. Ammu iy ɣa ṯeggem mliḥ aṭṭas ḏi ȓxir n ṣṣaḏaqa-ya ƹaweḏ. <verse eid="2CO 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 8:8" />War qqareɣ ca manaya ḏ ijjen n ȓuṣiyeṯ; Nec rezzuɣ aḏ jarrbeɣ lḥaqiqa n ȓemḥibbeṯ nwem iƹni tcabbaheɣ min teggem kenniw ak mammec tḥawaȓen iwḏan nneɣni s wuȓawen nsen <char style="it">ḏi ȓxeḏmeṯ-a</char>. <verse eid="2CO 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 8:9" />Aqa ṯessnem arḍa n Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa Lmasiḥ. Tuɣa netta ɣares kuȓci, walakin ƹlaḥsab neccin ismeḥ ḏi kuȓci manayenni bac aɣarneɣ yiȓi kuȓci s manayenni iy ḏi ismeḥ.<verse eid="2CO 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 8:10" />Ȓexxu nec aḏawem uceɣ array inu ḏi manaya, azzayes ṯawim nnfaƹ. Azeḏɣaṯ kenniw ig iṣeddqen ḏ imezwura; u kenniw ƹaweḏ ḏ imezwura iy ṯexsem aḏ teggem manayenni. <verse eid="2CO 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 8:11" />Ȓexxu u labud aḏ tkemmȓem ccɣeȓ-a s min ṯzemmarem aḏ tṣeddqem. Iƹni min ṯebḏam s wuȓawen nwem, iwa ƹaweḏ kemmȓem-ṯ. <verse eid="2CO 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 8:12" />Liʼanna bnaḏem meȓa s ȓxaḍar nnes, min ɣa iṣeddeq aḏ itwaqbeȓ. Walakin ƹlaḥsab min ɣares ḏ agȓa maci ƹlaḥsab min war ɣares.<verse eid="2CO 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 8:13" />Cuf, neccin ma nrezzu aḏ tucem fus i yiwḏan nneɣni, axawem ibesseȓ dqeȓ? Lla, nrezzu mkuȓ ijjen aɣares yiȓi ȓḥaqq nnes nican. <verse eid="2CO 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 8:14" />Ḏi ȓweqṯ-a ṯanita min ḏawem ɣa iceṭṭen ḏ agȓa aḏ infeƹ i min teḥḏajan niṯni. Menbaƹd, min ḏasen ɣa iceṭṭen aḏ infeƹ i min teḥḏajam kenniw. Ammu iy ɣa yiȓi ȓḥaqq nnes nican i mkuȓ ijjen. <verse eid="2CO 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 8:15" />Mammec iqqar Lkitab: "Wenni ismunen aṭṭas war ḏas itceṭṭi walu, wenni ismunen ḏrus war ḏas itxeṣṣi walu."<verse eid="2CO 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ssekken Titus ḏ can n wawmaṯen ɣar ṯendint n Kurinṯ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 8:16" />A neḥmeḏ Arebbi wami ḏas igga ḏeg wuȓ i Titus nnefs n ȓxaḍar iy ɣari nec xawem. <verse eid="2CO 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 8:17" />Iqbeȓ Titus ṭṭalab nneɣ, u ktar itegg marra ṯizemmar nnes aɣarwem d yas s ȓxaḍar nnes nniṯ. <verse eid="2CO 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 8:18" />Ak Titus nessekk umaṯneɣ nni maƹruf ɣar marra ṯijumaƹ n ȓmuminin x ȓxeḏmeṯ itegg ƹlaḥsab Lʼinjil. <verse eid="2CO 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 8:19" />Maci manayenni waha, qa xḍarent-ṯ-iḏ ṯjumaƹ n ȓmuminin bac akiḏneɣ isafar xmi ɣa neksi ȓxir n ṣṣaḏaqa-ya. Nkellef x ṣṣaḏaqa-ya i lƹaḍama n Siḏiṯneɣ s yixef nnes u bac aḏ d imeḍhar mammec ntegg ṯizemmar a nƹawen. <verse eid="2CO 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 8:20" />Ammu nexs axaneɣ nesbeƹƹeḏ aya n ȓƹib iy xaneɣ ɣa inin x mammec iy ɣa nkellef x ṣṣaḏaqa-ya ṯameqqrant. <verse eid="2CO 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 8:21" />Ntegg ṯizemmar bac a negg min iǧan ḏ aṣebḥan maci ƹlaḥsab Siḏi Arebbi waha, ntegg ƹaweḏ ƹlaḥsab min twaȓan yiwḏan.<verse eid="2CO 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CO 8:22" />Ƹaweḏ nessekk akiḏsen umaṯneɣ nneɣni aṭṭas n ṯwaȓaṯin njarreb-iṯ nufi-ṯ ixeddem mliḥ s wuȓ nnes. Ȓexxu ƹlaḥsab ttiqeṯ ṯameqqrant iy ɣares ḏaywem ixeddem s wuȓ nnes ƹaḏ ktar zi min tuɣa ixeddem qbeȓ. <verse eid="2CO 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CO 8:23" />Meȓa sseqsan x Titus, netta icarrec akiḏi ixeddem akiḏi jarawem. Meȓa sseqsan x ayṯmaṯneɣ yina, niṯni ssekkant-ṯen ṯjumaƹ n ȓmuminin sbeyyanen-d lƹaḍama n Lmasiḥ. <verse eid="2CO 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CO 8:24" />Falihaḏa, awim-asen i iryazen-a ddalil n ȓemḥibbeṯ nwem ḏ ssabab s minzi nteftaxar ḏaywem bac manaya aṯ ẓrent ṯijumaƹ n ȓmuminin.<verse eid="2CO 8:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="2CO 9" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1-2" style="v" sid="2CO 9:1-2" />Amma ṣṣaḏaqa i ṣṣaliḥin bȓa ma ḏawem d ariɣ, qa nec ssneɣ ṯrezzum aḏ tƹawnem ḏeɣya. Teftaxareɣ nec s manaya ɣar Ayṯ-Masidunya, qqareɣ-asen qa zeg wazeḏɣaṯ kenniw ḏi lʼiqlim n Uxaya ṯsewjaḏem-d bac aḏ tṣeddqem. Ȓxaḍar-a nwem itcejjaƹ azyen-ameqqran aḏ ṣeddqen. <verse eid="2CO 9:1-2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 9:3" />U ssekkeɣ-d ɣarwem ayṯmaṯneɣ Titus ḏ ṯnayen-a nneɣni bac lʼiftixar nneɣ ḏaywem war itiȓi ca ḏ ȓbaṭeȓ waha, ataf aḏ tiȓim ṯsewjaḏem mammec tuɣa ḏasen nniɣ nec. <verse eid="2CO 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 9:4" />Menbaƹd meȓa usin-d akiḏi ȓebƹaḍ zi Ayṯ-Masidunya ufin-kenniw war ṯeswejḏem ca ataf neccin a nseḏḥa x ttiqeṯ nneɣ ḏaywem (uȓa ḏ kenniw aḏ tseḏḥam). <verse eid="2CO 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 9:5" />S manaya ufiɣ u labud aḏ cejjƹeɣ ayṯmaṯneɣ yina iy ḏayi d izwaren ɣarwem zic bac aḏ ƹeḏȓen marra x ṣṣaḏaqa-ya ṯameqqrant iy zi <char style="it">ḏayi</char> ṯƹahḏem zi qbeȓ. Ammu aḏ tiȓi ṣṣaḏaqa-ya mujuda s wuȓawen nwem maci s bessif.<verse eid="2CO 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ṣṣaḏaqa tas-d s ȓefraḥeṯ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 9:6" />Fekkareṯ, wenni ɣa izerƹen ḏrus aḏ imjar ḏrus. Wenni ɣa izerƹen aṭṭas aḏ imjar aṭṭas. <verse eid="2CO 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 9:7" />Kuȓ ijjen itxeṣṣa-yas aḏ iṣeddeq s min inwa ḏeg wuȓ nnes maci s uxeyyaq niɣ s bessif, minzi Arebbi itexs wenni itṣeddaqen s ȓefraḥeṯ. <verse eid="2CO 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 9:8" />Arebbi netta izemmar akenniw isfeyyeḍ s lbaraka bac ataf ȓebda aɣarwem yiȓi min teḥḏajam marra ṯumma aḏ tarnim aṭṭas ḏi marra ȓxeḏmeṯ ṯaṣebḥant. <verse eid="2CO 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 9:9" />Mammec iqqar Lkitab: &lt;Netta iferreq aṭṭas uca yuca-asen i ipubriṯen, ȓḥaqq ig itegg netta itduma i ȓebda.&gt;<verse eid="2CO 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 9:10" />Wenni ig iferrqen zzarriƹeṯ i ufeǧaḥ nni ig izerrƹen iticc-as ƹaweḏ uȓa ḏ aɣrum iy ɣa icc, ataf netta ƹaweḏ aḏawem yarni ḏi zzarriƹeṯ nni iy ṯzerrƹem aḏ isemɣar min ṯmejjarem zi ṣṣaḏaqa-ya nwem. <verse eid="2CO 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 9:11" />Aɣarwem yiȓi ȓxir aṭṭas ḏi marra bac ataf aḏ tiȓim ṣaxiyin. U xmi ɣa nessiweḍ ṣṣaḏaqa-ya nwem aḏ teḏweȓ ḏ ijjen n ccuker i Arebbi. <verse eid="2CO 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 9:12" />Liʼanna ṣṣaḏaqa-ya iy teggem maci ɣir tƹemmar zzayes ifassen ixwan n ȓmuminin ṣṣaliḥin <char style="it">ḏi Lquds</char>; Lla, nettaṯ ƹaweḏ itenfeyyaḍ zzayes aṭṭas n ccuker i Arebbi. <verse eid="2CO 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 9:13" />Ṣṣaḏaqa-ya ṯuca ddalil xawem, zzayes iy ɣa ḥemḏen ṣṣaliḥin Arebbi. Ṯumnem s Lʼinjil n Lmasiḥ, ṯṭaƹem-as xmi tṣeddaqem aṭṭas xasen u x marra iwḏan. <verse eid="2CO 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 9:14" />Rezzun xawem tẓaǧan xawem ƹlaḥsab arḍa nni ameqqran iy ḏawem yuca Arebbi. <verse eid="2CO 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 9:15" />A neḥmeḏ Arebbi x lhadiya nni nnes, war nzemmar at newṣef.<verse eid="2CO 9:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="2CO 10" />
  <para style="s">Arrasul Bulus itḏafaƹ x ȓxeḏmeṯ nnes</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 10:1" />Fa nec ḏ Bulus, s yixef inu tṭalabeɣ-kenniw s ttawaḍuƹ ḏ lḥanana n Lmasiḥ. Wah, <char style="it">ṯeqqarem</char> nec zaƹma terjijiɣ xmi tiȓiɣ akiḏwem, xmi tɣabeɣ xawem tqesiḥeɣ. <verse eid="2CO 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 10:2" />Tettareɣ-kenniw bac war ḏayi tijjim ca aḏ iȓiɣ qesḥeɣ ak ȓebƹaḏ zzaywem am trajiɣ nec aḏ ggeɣ, ȓebƹaḍ-a tfekkaren qa netƹic s array n bnaḏem waha. <verse eid="2CO 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 10:3" />Ḏ ṣṣaḥ netƹic am bnaḏem, walakin war netḥarib ca am bnaḏem. <verse eid="2CO 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 10:4" />Ȓesnaḥ nneɣ maci am wenni ig isxeddam bnaḏem, ɣarneɣ ijjen n ȓesnaḥ nneɣ zi Siḏi Arebbi zzayes iy netrezza imucan ijehḏen. <verse eid="2CO 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 10:5" />Netrezza awaȓen ḏ kuȓ array iy ḏi iǧa ttakebbur ig itƹarraḍen i min nessen x Arebbi. Nḥebbes kuȓ lfikra ḥima ataf aḏ tṭaƹ i Lmasiḥ. <verse eid="2CO 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 10:6" />Xmi ɣa ṯessiwḍem kenniw nican ṭṭaƹa nwem, ataf neccin a niȓi nsewjaḏ bac a nƹaqeb wenni war itṭiƹin ca.<verse eid="2CO 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 10:7" />Kenniw ṯxezzarem ɣar min d itbanen x wuḏem waha. Meȓa can yijjen metʼakked netta zi Lmasiḥ u labud aḏ ifekkar uȓa ḏ neccin zi Lmasiḥ am netta. <verse eid="2CO 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 10:8" />Waxxa teftaxareɣ cwayt s ṣṣaraḥa-ya x ssulṭa nni iy ḏaneɣ yuca Siḏiṯneɣ, walakin war tseḏḥiɣ ca zi manaya. Ssulṭa-ya yuca-aneɣ-t ḥima akenniw nsejheḏ maci ḥima akenniw nrez. <verse eid="2CO 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 10:9" />War xseɣ ca aḏawem tɣiȓ belli nec akenniw siggwḏeɣ s ṯebraṯin inu. <verse eid="2CO 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 10:10" />Liʼanna qqaren <char style="it">xafi</char> ȓebƹaḍ <char style="it">zzaywem</char> qa ṯibraṯin n Bulus jehḏent qesḥent. <char style="it">U qqaren ƹaweḏ</char> walakin xmi akiḏneɣ itiȓi netta s yixef nnes iteḍƹif awaȓen nnes xwan. <verse eid="2CO 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 10:11" />Lla! Wenni issawaȓen amenni itxeṣṣa-yas aḏ issen min neƹna neccin ḏi ṯebraṯin-a nneɣ axmi netɣab, amenni iy ɣa nexḏem xmi d nḥeṭṭar.<verse eid="2CO 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 10:12" />Cuf, war nzemmar a nqaran ixef nneɣ niɣ a nmeṯṯel ixef nneɣ ak yinni itcekkaren i yixef nsen. Yina xmi tmeyyazen ixef nsen ak wayawya niɣ tmeṯṯalen ixef nsen ak wayawya iƹni ḏaysen ȓeqfaȓeṯ. <verse eid="2CO 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 10:13" />Walakin neccin a neftaxar s min iǧan nican maci ktar, a neftaxar s min ḏaneɣ ikellef Arebbi iƹni xawem kenniw. <verse eid="2CO 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 10:14" />Iwa kenniw, ma ikellef-aneɣ Arebbi xawem niɣ lla? Wah, neccin nuweḍ-d ɣarwem, nusa-d ɣarwem ḏ imezwura s Lʼinjil n Lmasiḥ. <verse eid="2CO 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 10:15" />War nteftaxar ca s ȓxeḏmeṯ iy ggin midden iƹni bac a nawi ccan nnes; Lla, neccin netmenna aḏ tarnim ḏi lʼiman nwem bac ƹaweḏ lḥudud nneɣ akiḏwem itmarni. <verse eid="2CO 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 10:16" />Ammu neccin a nbeccar s Lʼinjil ḏeg imucan aɣirin nwem, aqa war nexs ca a neftaxar s ȓxeḏmeṯ iy ggin midden. <verse eid="2CO 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 10:17" /><char style="it">Mamc iqqar Lkitab:</char> &lt;Wenni irezzun aḏ iftaxar, aḏ iftaxar netta zi Siḏi Arebbi.&gt; <verse eid="2CO 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 10:18" />Liʼanna maci wenni itqeddamen ixef nnes iy ɣa itwaqebbȓen; Lla, wenni iy ɣa itwaqebbȓen ḏ Siḏi Arebbi iy ṯ ɣa iqeddmen.<verse eid="2CO 10:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="2CO 11" />
  <para style="s">Arrasul Bulus aqaṯ ḍeḏ i yinni itarran ixef nsen ḏ arrusul</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1-2" style="v" sid="2CO 11:1-2" />Iwa rezzuɣ aḏ teṣbarem cwayt ak ṯubbuhȓiya-ya inu zaƹma. Wah, ṣebbareṯ akiḏi liʼanna ɣari ijjen n lɣira xawem, iƹni ijjen n lɣira zi Arebbi. Aqa xeṭbeɣ-kenniw zaƹma i yijjen n uryaz iƹni ḏ Lmasiḥ akenniw awiɣ ɣares am yijjen n ṯeƹzriyṯ war ḏayes bu ȓƹib. <verse eid="2CO 11:1-2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 11:3" />Walakin nec ggwḏeɣ mammec ḏas iwqeƹ i Ḥawwa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ḥawwa nettaṯ ḏ ṯamɣarṯ n Siḏna Adam.</char></note> icmeṯ-it ufiɣar<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Fiɣer itwaḥsab ḏ Cciṭan ḏi lʼaya-ya.</char></note> s ṯeḥraymiṯ nnes uȓa ḏ kenniw ȓaƹquȓaṯ nwem aḏ ffɣen abriḏ, war ḏas tṭiƹim ca i Lmasiḥ s wuȓawen nwem bȓa nnifaq u bȓa ȓƹib. <verse eid="2CO 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 11:4" />Liʼanna kenniw ṯeqqarem maƹlic waxxa yusa-d ɣarwem ijjen itbeccaren s yijjen n Ƹisa nneɣni mzuwwar maci ḏ wenni iy xef netbeccar neccin zi qbeȓ. Niɣ ḏeɣya ṯqebbȓem ijjen n arruḥ nneɣni mzuwwar maci ḏ wenni iy tuɣa ṯqebȓem zi qbeȓ. Niɣ ḏeɣya ṯqebbȓem ijjen n Lʼinjil nneɣni mzuwwar maci ḏ wenni iy tuɣa ṯqebȓem zi qbeȓ. <verse eid="2CO 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 11:5" />Cuf, war ḥessbeɣ ca ixef inu ḏ aneqṣi zi arrusul imezwura. Lla walu. <verse eid="2CO 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 11:6" />U nec waxxa war ssineɣ ca lxuṭba inu mliḥ, war ḏayi ṯenqiṣ ca ṯusna. Neccin ṯusna-ya nesbeyyen-awem-t-id nican s marra ṯimesȓayin.<verse eid="2CO 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 11:7" />Ma ḏ ȓƹib meȓa beccareɣ-kenniw s Lʼinjil n Arebbi bȓa ma ḏayi ṯxeǧsem, iƹni semzayeɣ ixef inu bac akenniw sgaƹƹḏeɣ? <verse eid="2CO 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 11:8" />Nec jemƹeɣ-d tmenyaṯ zi ṯjumaƹ nneɣni n ȓmuminin qebȓeɣ zzaysen manayenni bac akiḏwem xeḏmeɣ. <verse eid="2CO 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 11:9" />Wami ḥḍareɣ akiḏwem tuɣa nec teḥḏajiɣ, war tbessaȓeɣ x ḥadd zzaywem; Lla, ucin-ayi min teḥḏajiɣ ayṯmaṯneɣ yinni iy d yusin zi Masidunya. Amenni ugiɣ axawem bessȓeɣ, aḏ qqimeɣ mestammer amenni. <verse eid="2CO 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 11:10" />S ȓḥaqq n Lmasiḥ iy ḏayi, uȓa ḏ ijjen ḏeg imucan n Uxaya ma aḏ ikkes lʼiftixar-a inu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Iƹni yugi Bulus axasen ibesseȓ x ȓmuminin n Ayṯ-Kurinṯ bac aṯ ƹawnen ḏi ȓxeḏmeṯ nnes n Lʼinjil s tmenyaṯ nsen.</char></note> <verse eid="2CO 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 11:11" />Mayemmi? Ma war kenniw texseɣ ca? Qa Arebbi issen <char style="it">belli ṯƹizzem xafi</char>.<verse eid="2CO 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 11:12" />Fa min teggeɣ aḏ qqimeɣ ammu teggeɣ-ṯ. Mayemmi? Xseɣ aḏ qesseɣ iḍaren i yinni irezzun lfurṣa aḏ iȓin mquddan akiḏneɣ ḏi ṯmesȓayin-a iy xef teftaxaren. <verse eid="2CO 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 11:13" />Cuf, iryazen am yina tarran ixef nsen ḏ arrusul xeddmen ḏ iɣeddaren, sneƹmiȓen ḏ arrusul n Lmasiḥ. <verse eid="2CO 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 11:14" />Iwa war nesteɣȓib ca liʼanna Cciṭan netta s yixef nnes isneƹmiȓ ḏ ijjen n lmalaʼika n nnur. <verse eid="2CO 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 11:15" />Falihaḏa, war nesteɣȓib ca meȓa ixeddamen n Cciṭan sneƹmiȓen ḏ ixeddamen n ȓḥaqq. Ȓefna nsen aḏ yiȓi ƹlaḥsab min staḥqent ȓefƹayeȓ nsen.<verse eid="2CO 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Arrasul Bulus ḏ ȓemḥayen nnes</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 11:16" />Aḏ iniɣ ƹaweḏ, war ḏayi ḥessbeṯ ca ḏ abuhaȓi. Waxxa ṯḥesbem-ayi ḏ abuhaȓi, qebbȓem-ayi bac aḏ ftaxareɣ cwayt. <verse eid="2CO 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 11:17" />Manaya iy zi teftaxareɣ qqareɣ-ṯ nec am yijjen n ṯubbuhȓiya, war ṯ iqqar ca Siḏiṯneɣ. <verse eid="2CO 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 11:18" />Xmi teftaxaren yiwḏan-a aṭṭas ƹlaḥsab min itegg bnaḏem, uȓa ḏ nec aḏ ftaxareɣ. <verse eid="2CO 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 11:19" />Ma kenniw zaƹma ṯfehmem mliḥ? Iwa, mayemmi s ȓefraḥeṯ ṯṣebbarem ibuhaȓiyen? <verse eid="2CO 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 11:20" />Aqa ṯṣebbarem uȓa ḏ yinni iy kenniw itarran ḏ isemɣan, ḏ yinni iy kenniw itetten, ḏ yinni iy xawem itbuṣaren, ḏ yinni iy ḏi iǧa ttakebbur, ḏ yinni iy kenniw iccaṯen s iseqqiȓen. <verse eid="2CO 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 11:21" />Nec tseḏḥiɣ zaƹma, neccin neḍƹef war nzemmar a nexḏem amenni!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CO 11:21">Qqareɣ nec zaƹma s ṯubbuhȓiya-ya qa meȓmi ma izƹem ḥadd azzayes iftaxar uȓa ḏ nec azzayes ftaxareɣ. <verse eid="2CO 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CO 11:22" />Meȓa niṯni ḏ iƹibraniyen, uȓa ḏ nec <char style="it">ḏ aƹibrani</char>. Meȓa niṯni zi Ayṯ-Israʼil, uȓa ḏ nec <char style="it">ḏ aʼisraʼili</char>. Meȓa niṯni usin-d zi ṯarwa n Brahim, uȓa ḏ nec <char style="it">usiɣ-d zi ṯarwa n Brahim</char>. <verse eid="2CO 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CO 11:23" />Meȓa niṯni ḏ ixeddamen n Lmasiḥ, uȓa ḏ nec ḥsen ƹaḏ <char style="it">ḏ axeddam n Lmasiḥ</char> (ssawaȓeɣ zaƹma s ṯubbuhȓiya-ya). Nec ccaṯeɣ tamara ktar zzaysen, ḥebbsen-ayi ktar zzaysen, uwṯin-ayi s usɣun ktar zzaysen. Nec mecḥaȓ n ṯwaȓaṯin twajaheɣ ȓmewṯ. <verse eid="2CO 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CO 11:24" />Xemsa n ṯwaȓaṯin ccaṯen-ayi israʼiliyen s arbeƹin n ṯyiṯa qell icten s usɣun. <verse eid="2CO 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CO 11:25" />Ṯȓaṯa n ṯwaȓaṯin tmarraṯen-ayi s uƹmuḏ. Ijjen n ṯwaȓa rejmen-ayi s uzru. Ṯȓaṯa n ṯwaȓaṯin iɣreq zzayi uɣarrabu seƹḏuɣ ijjen n wass ḏ yijjen n ǧiȓeṯ ḏi ȓebḥar. <verse eid="2CO 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CO 11:26" />Nec mecḥaȓ n ṯwaȓaṯin tiȓiɣ tsafareɣ ḏi lxaṭar n iɣezran, ḏ lxaṭar n iceffaren, ḏ lxaṭar n ȓqum inu, ḏ lxaṭar n iyunaniyen, ḏ lxaṭar ḏi ṯendint, ḏ lxaṭar ḏi ȓexȓa, ḏ lxaṭar ḏi ȓebḥar, ḏ lxaṭar n yinni itarran ixef nsen ḏ ayṯma. <verse eid="2CO 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CO 11:27" />Xeddmeɣ, ccaṯeɣ tamara, tnuseɣ aṭṭas n ǧiyaȓi bȓa iḍeṣ. Fuḏeɣ ǧuzeɣ, qqimeɣ aṭṭas n ṯwaȓaṯin bȓa lmakla. Ṯneqq-ayi ṯesmeḍ arruḍ inu ḏ uqlil. <verse eid="2CO 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2CO 11:28" />Iwa qaƹ ṯimesȓayin-a u ƹaḏ ḏayi amnus kuȓ nhar ƹlaḥsab marra ṯijumaƹ n ȓmuminin. <verse eid="2CO 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2CO 11:29" />Meȓa can yijjen iḍƹef, nec ma war teḍƹifeɣ ca? Meȓa can yijjen itwasufeɣ zeg ubriḏ, nec ma war ḏayi iteqqes ca wuȓ inu?<verse eid="2CO 11:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2CO 11:30" />Meȓa nec u labud aḏ ftaxareɣ, aḏ ftaxareɣ s min ḏayi d isbeyyanen ḍeƹfeɣ. <verse eid="2CO 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2CO 11:31" />Wenni itwabarken i ȓebda iƹni Arebbi Babas n Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa, issen illa nec qqareɣ lḥaqiqa. <verse eid="2CO 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2CO 11:32" />Ḏi ṯendint n Dimaceq qa lwali n uzeǧiḏ Ḥariṯ igga ȓƹasseṯ ḏi ṯendint ḥima aḏayi iṭṭef. <verse eid="2CO 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2CO 11:33" />Walakin sehwan-ayi-d <char style="it">imeḥḍaren inu</char> ḏeg yijjen n uqbub s iseɣwan zeg yijjen n ṯburjat n ṣṣur n ṯendint ȓexddenni nejmeɣ zeg ifassen nnes.<verse eid="2CO 11:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="2CO 12" />
  <para style="s">Jjheḏ ḏ ḍḍuƹef n arrasul Bulus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 12:1" />U labud aḏ ftaxareɣ ƹaḏ, waxxa war ḏayes bu nnfaƹ. Aḏ ssiwȓeɣ ȓexxu x ṯmesȓayin iy d ihwan ḏi lwaḥi ḏ ṯmesȓayin innufaren iy d isbeyyen Siḏiṯneɣ. <verse eid="2CO 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 12:2" />Ijjen n uryaz iǧan ḏi Lmasiḥ,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ḏi lʼayaṯ-a arrasul Bulus issawaȓ x yixef nnes.</char></note> aqa ssneɣ-ṯ <char style="it">ḏ nec</char>. Arbeƹṭac iseggwusa zeg wami itwaxḍef ɣar ujenna wis ṯȓaṯa. Ma itwaxḍef s ddat niɣ bȓa ddat manayenni war ṯ ssineɣ ca nec, issen-iṯ illa Arebbi. <verse eid="2CO 12:2" /><verse number="3-4" style="v" sid="2CO 12:3-4" />Aryaz-a ssneɣ itwaxḍef ɣar jjeneṯ. Ma itwaxḍef s ddat niɣ bȓa ddat manayenni war ṯ ssineɣ ca nec, issen-iṯ illa Arebbi. Aryaz-a iṣenneṭ i ṯmesȓayin war twaneṭṭiqent ca, war ḏas itwasmiḥ ca i bnaḏem aṯent inṭeq. <verse eid="2CO 12:3-4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 12:5" />Ijjen n uryaz am wanita zemmareɣ nec azzayes ftaxareɣ. Walakin war teftaxareɣ ca zi min ḏayi d yusin, teftaxareɣ zi ḍḍuƹef inu u ṣafi. <verse eid="2CO 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 12:6" />Cuf, mȓi xseɣ aḏ ftaxareɣ zeg yixef inu ataf ssawaȓeɣ s ȓḥaqq maci s ṯubbuhȓiya. Walakin ugiɣ aḏ ggeɣ ammu, mayemmi? Ḥima aḏayi ḥesben yiwḏan ɣir s min twaȓan ḏayi <char style="it">s ṯiṭṭawin nsen</char> u ḏ min tṣennaṭen zzayi <char style="it">s imejjan nsen</char>.<verse eid="2CO 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 12:7" />Iḏen immuc-ayi ijjen n usennan ḏeg uysum inu,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Maci maƹruf min iƹna usennan-a mixef issawaȓ arrasul Bulus, walakin issawaȓ s ȓmaƹna. Imken ḏ ijjen n lmaraḍ iy ṯ itcukan s jjheḏ.</char></note> mayemmi? Ḥima war semɣareɣ ca ixef inu ƹlaḥsab ṯimesȓayin-a istƹejjiben iy ḏayi d isbeyyen Arebbi ḏi lwaḥi. Asennan-a wenni iy d issekken Cciṭan itƹeddab-ayi bac war semɣareɣ ca ixef inu. <verse eid="2CO 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 12:8" />Ttareɣ-as i Siḏiṯneɣ ṯȓaṯa n ṯwaȓaṯin bac axafi isbeƹƹeḏ manaya. <verse eid="2CO 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 12:9" />Netta inna-ayi lla, icfa-yac arḍa inu; Jjheḏ inu aḏ iḏweȓ ikmaȓ s ḍḍuƹef-a. Falihaḏa farrḥeɣ aṭṭas aḏ ftaxareɣ s ḍḍuƹef n jjheḏ inu bac jjheḏ n Lmasiḥ aḏayi izḏeɣ. <verse eid="2CO 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 12:10" />S manaya ƹlaḥsab Lmasiḥ nec farrḥeɣ s ḍḍuƹef inu ḏ ṯukkwra ḏ tamara ḏ uƹeddeb ḏ uziyyar. Mayemmi? Meȓa ḍeƹfeɣ ȓexddenni nec aḏ iȓiɣ jehḏeɣ.<verse eid="2CO 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Arrasul Bulus ikessi amnus x ȓmuminin n Ayṯ-Kurinṯ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 12:11" />Ƹaḏ ssawaȓeɣ s ṯubbuhȓiya-ya zaƹma, ḏ kenniw iy xafi ibezzen ammu. Cuf, tuɣa itxeṣṣa-kenniw aḏayi ṯcekarem, mayemmi? Liʼanna nec waxxa ḏ walu iy ǧiɣ, war ǧiɣ bu ḏ aneqṣi zi arrusul nni imezwura. <verse eid="2CO 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 12:12" />Ṯimesȓayin nni iy d isbeyyanen nec ḏ arrasul iy ǧiɣ niṯenti tuɣa twaxeȓqent-id jarawem s yijjen n ṣṣbar ḏ ameqqran, iƹni lƹalamaṯ ḏ lmuƹjizaṯ ḏ lburhanaṯ. <verse eid="2CO 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 12:13" />Ma ḏinni ca n ṯmesȓayṯ minxef arḍiɣ nec ḏi ṯjumaƹ n ȓmuminin ṯinneɣni war xas arḍiɣ ca jarawem? Wah icten, iƹni war xawem tbessiȓeɣ ca!<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Iƹni war xasen ibesseȓ ca Bulus ȓaḥeqqac yugi aḏ iqbeȓ tmenyaṯ zzaysen bac aṯ ƹawnen niṯni ḏi ȓxeḏmeṯ nnes ḏi Lʼinjil.</char></note> Semḥem-ayi x falṭa-ya.<verse eid="2CO 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 12:14" />Ȓexxu aqayi wejḏeɣ aɣarwem d aseɣ ḏi zziyara wis ṯȓaṯa. War xawem tbessiȓeɣ ca, war rezzuɣ ca x wagȓa nwem rezzuɣ xawem kenniw. Ȓaḥeqqac war itxeṣṣi ca iḥenjiren aḏ smunen agȓa i lwalidin nsen, itxeṣṣa lwalidin nsen iy ɣa ismunen agȓa i iḥenjiren. <verse eid="2CO 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 12:15" />Nec s ȓefraḥeṯ aḏ hḏiɣ ixef inu aḏ twahḏiɣ ƹlaḥsab ȓaƹmar nwem. Meȓa texseɣ-kenniw aṭṭas, ma ṯesneqṣem ȓemḥibbeṯ nwem xafi?<verse eid="2CO 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 12:16" />Iwa ṣafi, meȓa war xawem bessȓeɣ ca, ma ṯeqqarem ȓexxu qa nec ḏ aɣeccac ṭṭfeɣ-kenniw s ṯeḥraymiṯ, ah? <verse eid="2CO 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 12:17" />Ma ṯenwim xewwneɣ-kenniw s yijjen zeg yinni tuɣa ɣarwem d ssekkeɣ? Lla, walu. <verse eid="2CO 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 12:18" />Ḏ nec iy d iweṣṣan Titus aɣarwem d yas, ssekkeɣ-d akiḏes umaṯneɣ nni. War izemmar akenniw iɣecc Titus. Nec ḏ netta nxeddem s yijjen n ȓaƹqeȓ ḏ ijjen, isurifen nneɣ ḏ ijjen.<verse eid="2CO 12:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 12:19" />Mecḥaȓ zeg wami ṯnewwam zaƹma ndafeƹ x yixef nneɣ zzaṯwem <char style="it">waha</char>? Lla ay imƹizzen inu, nessawaȓ marra manaya ḏi Lmasiḥ zzaṯ i Arebbi bac akenniw nsejheḏ. <verse eid="2CO 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 12:20" />Cuf, ggwḏeɣ xmi d ɣa awḍeɣ war kenniw tifeɣ ca mammec tmenniɣ akenniw afeɣ. U ƹaweḏ war ḏayi tifem ca mammec tmennim aḏayi ṯafem. Ggwḏeɣ aḏ afeɣ jarawem amenɣi ḏ ȓeḥseḏ ḏ uƹaṣṣeb, kuȓ ijjen irezzu i yixef nnes waha, ḏ ȓbaṭeȓ ḏ nnamima, ḏaywem ttakebbur ḏ ȓfawḍa. <verse eid="2CO 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 12:21" />Ggwḏeɣ aɣarwem d ƹeqbeɣ aḏ seḏḥiɣ zi Arebbi inu aḏ ruɣ aṭṭas x yinni ig iƹṣan zi qbeȓ, ƹaḏ war tuben ca zeg ufelles ḏ lfasad ḏ ȓeqbaḥeṯ iy tuɣa teggen.<verse eid="2CO 12:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="2CO 13" />
  <para style="s">Arrasul Bulus iƹeǧem i yinni iy ḏas itƹarraḍen</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 13:1" />Ṯanita ḏ zziyara wis ṯȓaṯa taseɣ-d ɣarwem. <char style="it">Mamc iqqar Lkitab:</char> &lt;Kuȓ ttuhma axas cehḏen ḏ ddalil ṯnayen n ȓechuḏ niɣ ṯȓaṯa.&gt; <verse eid="2CO 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 13:2" />Nec ḏi zziyara iy tuɣa d ggiɣ ɣarwem wis ṯnayen ƹeȓmeɣ-asen i yinni iƹeṣṣan ḏ yiwḏan nneɣni marra. Ȓexxu xmi xawem tɣabiɣ aḏawem ƹeȓmeɣ ƹaweḏ, iƹni xmi d ɣa awḍeɣ uȓa ḏ ijjen zeg yinni iƹeṣṣan ma axas ḥinneɣ. <verse eid="2CO 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 13:3" />Mayemmi? Liʼanna ṯrezzum ddalil Lmasiḥ issawaȓ zzayi. Ma iḍƹef netta ḏi ȓwesṭ nwem? Lla, ijheḏ jarawem. <verse eid="2CO 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 13:4" />Wah, netta itwaṣelleb x ṣṣalib s ḍḍuƹef, wa innama iteddar s jjheḏ n Arebbi. Amenni uȓa ḏ neccin. Neḍƹef am ḍḍuƹef nnes netta, wa innama jarawem nteddar akiḏes netta s jjheḏ n Arebbi.<verse eid="2CO 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 13:5" />Jarrbeṯ ixef nwem ma aqa kenniw ḏi lʼiman. Rajƹeṯ ixef nwem. Yac ṯessnem qa Ƹisa Lmasiḥ aqaṯ ḏaywem? Iƹni meȓa war ṯesqiṭem ca. <verse eid="2CO 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 13:6" />U nec tteyyqeɣ illa kenniw aḏaneɣ ṯafem neccin war nesqiṭ ca. <verse eid="2CO 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 13:7" />Ntettar-as i Arebbi bac war ṯƹeṣṣim ca, maci bac aḏaneɣ afen yiwḏan war nesqiṭ ca ḏi ttuhma-ya iy xawem nqeddem; Lla, neccin nrezzu aḏ teggem min iǧan nican. Meȓa zɣiȓ-asen i ȓebƹaḍ qa nesqeṭ zaƹma ḏi ttuhma-ya iy xawem nqeddem, iwa maƹlic. <verse eid="2CO 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 13:8" />Cuf, war nzemmar a negg walu ḍed i lḥaqiqa; nxeddem i lḥaqiqa. <verse eid="2CO 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 13:9" />Liʼanna nfarreḥ meȓmi ma neḍƹef, kenniw tiȓim ṯjehḏem. Ḏ manaya mixef nrezzu ḏi ṯẓaǧiṯ nneɣ aḏ tṣeȓḥem nican. <verse eid="2CO 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 13:10" />S manaya iy tariɣ nec ṯimesȓayin-a ḏi ṯebrat-a nec ɣabeɣ xawem. Ammu xmi iy d ɣa ƹeqbeɣ ɣarwem war xseɣ ca aḏ iȓiɣ qesḥeɣ akiḏwem ƹlaḥsab ssulṭa nni iy ḏayi yuca Siḏiṯneɣ. Yuca-ayi-t bac akenniw sjehḏeɣ maci akenniw rzeɣ.<verse eid="2CO 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lxitam n ṯebrat-a</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 13:11" />Ṣafi ay ayṯma, farrḥeṯ. Ṣeȓḥeṯ ibriḏen nwem nican. Tṣennaṭeṯ ɣari min ḏawem qqareɣ. Iȓiṯ ḏ ijjen ḏi array nwem. Tƹiceṯ ḏi ȓehna. Arebbi nneɣ n ȓemḥibbeṯ ḏ ȓehna aḏ yiȓi akiḏwem. <verse eid="2CO 13:11" /><verse number="12-13" style="v" sid="2CO 13:12-13" />Tseǧameṯ x wayawya s yijjen n sȓam iṣfa. Tseǧamen-d xawem marra ȓmuminin ṣṣaliḥin. <verse eid="2CO 13:12-13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 13:14" />Arḍa n Siḏiṯneɣ Ƹisa Lmasiḥ ḏ ȓemḥibbeṯ n Arebbi ḏ umƹacar n Arruḥ iqeddsen akiḏwem yiȓi marra. <char style="it">Amin.</char><verse eid="2CO 13:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 13" />
</usx>